CM_ BO_ 2248476263 "EEPROM config readback frame 2: under-voltage threshold.";
CM_ BO_ 2264925799 "General ACK/NACK. Byte 0 = command echo, Byte 1 = 0x00=ACK / 0xFF=NACK.";
CM_ BO_ 2264991335 "Error log dump. One frame per error. Terminator = all 0xFF.";
CM_ BO_ 2265056871 "Error reset response. 0xBB=recovery, 0xAA=normal, 0xEE/0xCC=failed.";
CM_ BO_ 2153776743 "Toggle test LED. Any payload triggers toggle.";
CM_ BO_ 2165311079 "Enable/disable Drive high-side. Byte 0: 0=off, non-zero=on.";
CM_ BO_ 2165376615 "Enable/disable Extruder high-side. Byte 0: 0=off, non-zero=on.";
CM_ BO_ 2165442151 "Enable/disable Scrubbing high-side. Byte 0: 0=off, non-zero=on.";
CM_ BO_ 2168456807 "Set fan PWM. Byte 0: fan 1-5, Byte 1: speed 0-100%.";
CM_ BO_ 2181039719 "Write EEPROM setting. Byte 0: selector, Byte 1-2: value u16 LE.";
CM_ BO_ 2181105255 "Request EEPROM config dump. No payload. Response on 0x604/0x605.";
CM_ BO_ 2265122407 "Request error log dump. No payload. Response on 0x701.";
CM_ BO_ 2265187943 "Reset from ERROR to RECOVERY. Byte 0 must be 0xAA.";
